question:
Priority queue sau thêm phần tử rồi sort lại cả mảng. Mỗi lần `enqueue` tốn bao nhiêu?
`enqueue(val, priority) {
  this.values.push({ val, priority });
  this.values.sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);
}`

questionEn:
This priority queue pushes and then re-sorts the whole array. What does each `enqueue` cost?
`enqueue(val, priority) {
  this.values.push({ val, priority });
  this.values.sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);
}`

